{"message":"Your identity is verified. I found 15 credit-card referrals on your account. The most recent one, for a Silver Rewards Card submitted on 11/13/2025, is marked **IN_PROGRESS**, meaning your friend has opened the account but has not yet completed the qualifying activity—or it has not been recorded yet.

For the Silver Rewards Card, the referred cardholder must spend at least **$750 within 60 days of account opening**. The bonus typically posts within **one to two billing cycles after** that requirement is met.

I also found several referrals marked **COMPLETE**, which means the requirements were recorded as satisfied. If you mean one of those rather than the 11/13 referral, please tell me the card type and approximate referral date so I can narrow down which one you’re asking about."}
